{"articleNo":"728","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=728&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"▦2009-1 일반대학원 졸업외국어시험 면제신청(1차) 안내▦","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.04.02","hit":"18870","attachments":[{"name":"졸업외국어시험면제신청원(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=728&attachNo=69444"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; WIDTH: 430px; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; HEIGHT: 34px\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: rgb(0,0,0) 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"420\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"30\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2009-1 일반대학원 졸업외국어시험 면제신청(1차) 안내</span></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">1. 신청자격 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><font color=\"#1e90ff\">2학기 이상 등록한 일반대학원 석ㆍ박사과정 재학생</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font color=\"#8b008b\"> <u>(수료자는 2009-1학기에 수료자 등록을 필한 자)</u></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">2. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶면제신청원 1부, 면제관련 증빙서류(사본) 1부 첨부 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">3. 졸업외국어시험 면제요건 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 대학원 해당과정 재학 중(최근 3년이내)에 TOEIC 성적이 500점</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(TOEFL, TEPS의 점수는 토익 500점에 상응하는 점수)이상을 취득한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 본교 대학원 해당과정 재학 중 어학교육원에서 시행하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">중급이상의 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<u><strong>영어강좌를 45시간 이상 이수한 자</strong></u> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">4. 졸업외국어시험 면제신청 접수기간 및 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: rgb(255,0,0); FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><font color=\"#ff1493\">2009. 4. 13(월) ~ 4. 16(목)[4일간]</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 면제신청원 양식 : 첨부파일 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">5. 합격자 발표 : <font color=\"#1e90ff\">2009. 4. 27(월) 원스톱서비스</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <u>☞ 경로 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/학적자료조회/외국어시험(Y or N)으로 표기</u></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
